<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>example<sp/>sets<sp/>up<sp/>the<sp/>ePWM<sp/>(MCPWM<sp/>in<sp/>case<sp/>of<sp/>F28E12xand<sp/>MCPC029)<sp/>to<sp/>periodically<sp/>trigger<sp/>the<sp/>ADC.<sp/>If<sp/>the<sp/>results<sp/>are<sp/>outside<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>defined<sp/>range,<sp/>the<sp/>post-processing<sp/>block<sp/>will<sp/>generate<sp/>an<sp/>interrupt.<sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>default<sp/>limits<sp/>are<sp/>1000LSBs<sp/>and<sp/>3000LSBs.<sp/>With<sp/>VREFHI<sp/>set<sp/>to<sp/>3.3V,<sp/>the<sp/>PPB<sp/>will<sp/>generate<sp/>an<sp/>interrupt<sp/>if<sp/>the<sp/>input<sp/>voltage<sp/>goes<sp/>above<sp/>about<sp/>2.4V<sp/>or<sp/>below<sp/>about<sp/>0.8V.</highlight></codeline>
